      },
      "classDescription": "As human expansion disturbs ancient horrors across the continent, high walls are rarely enough to keep the dark at bay. Calling themselves Dawnbringers, these solitary mercenaries serve as a ruthless line of defense against the threats their own people provoke. Relying on cold iron, crude alchemy, and hand-crossbows, they view hunting not as a heroic calling, but as a slow-burning retribution. They slip into the night to dismantle monsters before they ever reach the city gates, trading their blood and sanity for the promise of a quiet sunrise.",
